commit b6828d9c9d20493bbef611e3e8757f9595afd183

C03: Bluetooth radio verbs with clitics and voseo, wifi state questions read wifi.status (NETWORK1293)

effect_intent: «apagame/encendé/activá el bluetooth» reach bluetooth.radio.set (verb list and direct-request heads); «decime si el wifi está prendido» / «¿el wifi está encendido?» are a wifi.status read (_wifi_state_question; «decime si …» is an indirect question, not a deferred condition). __main__: «encende» grounds state=true.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>


